{
  "_about": "The equipment bank (RECIPE_VISUALIZATIONS.md 9.6): level \"standard\" is what most kitchens have, \"special\" the rest. kind \"supply\" (foil, plates) is planned with but not shown as equipment. same_as shows an item as another one (one symbol, listed once). image is the symbol, image_notes what it should show.",
